  "statement": "In the repository at commit 2436fae, add one new file named answer.txt at the repository root. Its entire content is exactly the two characters \"42\" followed by exactly one newline character (LF, 0x0A): the file is 3 bytes long, with no leading or trailing whitespace in addition to that single terminating newline, no byte-order mark, and no trailing blank line. No other file in the repository may be added, modified, renamed or deleted; the only difference between the repository before and after the change is the new answer.txt file.",
  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    {
